				<r3d:description language="eng">IDEALS is an institutional repository that collects, disseminates, and provides persistent and reliable access to the research and scholarship of faculty, staff, and students at the University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign. Faculty, staff, graduate students, and in some cases undergraduate students, can deposit their research and scholarship directly into IDEALS. Departments can use IDEALS to distribute their working papers, technical reports, or other research material. Contact us at https://www.ideals.illinois.edu/feedback for more information.</r3d:description>
